METRIC DEFINITIONS - APPROXIMATE vs STANDARD (for paper methodology / Threats to Validity)
============================================================================================

This project computes lightweight, javalang-based APPROXIMATIONS of several
well-known metrics. None of them should be reported under the bare standard
name in the paper; use the '-approx' names below and cite this file's
deviation list in Threats to Validity.

cbo_approx (NOT standard CBO / Chidamber & Kemerer)
----------------------------------------------------
Counts distinct type NAMES syntactically referenced in the class (field
